#: src/app/Transports/Restful/Recipe/Legacy_Rest_Hooks.php:123
msgctxt "Legacy REST hook notice"
msgid "8.0.0 has no supported before-save hook. To change a value a trigger or action stores, match operation() 'created' or 'updated' and item_type() 'trigger' or 'action', then update the stored value with update_post_meta( item_id(), $key, wp_slash( $value ) ). The event fires for builder, MCP and automator_*() saves alike."
msgstr ""

#: src/app/Transports/Restful/Recipe/Legacy_Rest_Hooks.php:128
msgctxt "Legacy REST hook notice"
msgid "Match operation() 'created' and item_type() 'trigger', or listen to automator_event_trigger_created; item_id() is the new trigger and recipe_id() its recipe. Both fire for builder, MCP and automator_*() saves alike, and automator_event_trigger_created also fires for each trigger a recipe copy or import adds."
msgstr ""

#: src/app/Transports/Restful/Recipe/Legacy_Rest_Hooks.php:132
msgctxt "Legacy REST hook notice"
msgid "Match operation() 'created' and item_type() 'action', or listen to automator_event_action_created; item_id() is the new action and recipe_id() its recipe. Both fire for builder, MCP and automator_*() saves alike, and automator_event_action_created also fires for each action a recipe copy or import adds."
msgstr ""

#: src/app/Transports/Restful/Recipe/Legacy_Rest_Hooks.php:144
msgctxt "Legacy REST hook notice"
msgid "8.0.0 has no supported before-save hook. To change a value a trigger or action stores, match operation() 'created' or 'updated' and item_type() 'trigger' or 'action', then update the stored value with update_post_meta( item_id(), $key, wp_slash( $value ) ). This filter runs for builder saves only; its return value is still stored."
msgstr ""

#: src/app/Transports/Restful/Recipe/Legacy_Rest_Hooks.php:148
msgctxt "Legacy REST hook notice"
msgid "Match operation() 'updated' and item_type() 'trigger' or 'action'. The event fires after the recipe's cache is cleared, so a listener reads the saved values."
msgstr ""

#: src/app/Transports/Restful/Recipe/Legacy_Rest_Hooks.php:152
msgctxt "Legacy REST hook notice"
msgid "Match operation() 'updated' and item_type() 'trigger' or 'action', then read the saved fields from automator_get_trigger( item_id() )['trigger']['configuration'] or automator_get_action_by_id( item_id() )['action']['config']. To act only when particular fields changed, listen to automator_event_trigger_fields_changed or automator_event_action_fields_changed, whose fields() lists them. This hook fires once per builder save: $meta_key is the item's main option code and $meta_value holds every field that save stored."
msgstr ""

#: src/app/Transports/Restful/Recipe/Legacy_Rest_Hooks.php:156
msgctxt "Legacy REST hook notice"
msgid "Match operation() 'updated' and item_type() 'trigger' or 'action', then read the saved fields from automator_get_trigger( item_id() )['trigger']['configuration'] or automator_get_action_by_id( item_id() )['action']['config']. To act only when particular fields changed, listen to automator_event_trigger_fields_changed or automator_event_action_fields_changed, whose fields() lists them. The events fire for builder, MCP and automator_*() saves alike. This filter's return value is no longer used."
msgstr ""

#: src/app/Transports/Restful/Recipe/Legacy_Rest_Hooks.php:160
msgctxt "Legacy REST hook notice"
msgid "Match operation() 'deleted' and item_type() 'trigger' or 'action'; item_id() is the deleted item and recipe_id() its recipe. The event also reports deleted blocks, block modifiers and recipes."
msgstr ""

#: src/app/Transports/Restful/Recipe/Legacy_Rest_Hooks.php:164
msgctxt "Legacy REST hook notice"
msgid "Listen to automator_event_recipe_status_changed, automator_event_trigger_status_changed or automator_event_action_status_changed: old_status() and new_status() give the change. automator_event_recipe_status_changed also fires when removing or switching off a recipe's last live trigger or action sets the recipe to draft; automator_event_recipe_changed reports that save as a trigger or action change."
msgstr ""

#: src/app/Transports/Restful/Recipe/Legacy_Rest_Hooks.php:188
msgctxt "Legacy REST hook notice"
msgid "Match operation() 'updated' and item_type() 'recipe', then read the terms with wp_get_post_terms( recipe_id(), 'recipe_category' ) or 'recipe_tag'. The event does not say which value changed."
msgstr ""

#: src/app/Transports/Restful/Recipe/Legacy_Rest_Hooks.php:192
msgctxt "Legacy REST hook notice"
msgid "Match operation() 'updated' and item_type() 'recipe', then read the run-as settings with automator_get_recipe_user_selector( recipe_id() ), which returns null when none are set. The event does not say which value changed."
msgstr ""

#: src/app/Transports/Restful/Recipe/Legacy_Rest_Hooks.php:196
msgctxt "Legacy REST hook notice"
msgid "Match operation() 'updated' and item_type() 'recipe', then read the order from automator_get_recipe_wire_service(), whose get_wire_array( recipe_id() )['flow']['content'] lists the actions and blocks in order. The event does not say which value changed."
msgstr ""

#: src/app/Transports/Restful/Recipe/Legacy_Rest_Hooks.php:200
msgctxt "Legacy REST hook notice"
msgid "Match operation() 'created' and item_type() 'action', or listen to automator_event_action_created; item_id() is the copy and recipe_id() its recipe. Both also fire for an action added any other way."
msgstr ""

